question:
$已知数列a_n满足a_1=1，a_n \cdot a_{n+1}=9^n，n \in N^.$
$若b_n=\left\{
\begin{matrix}
\log_{\frac{1}{3}}a_n, & n\text{为奇数},\\ 
a_n-1, & n\text{为偶数},
\end{matrix}
\right.$
$求数列{b_n}的前2n项和S_{2n}.$

$设a_n是等差数列，b_n是等比数列，公比大于0.已知a_1=b_1=3,b_2=a_3,b_3=4a_2+3.$
$设数列c_n满足：$
$$
c_n = \begin{cases} 
1, & \text{if } n \text{ is odd} \\
b_{\frac{n}{2}}, & \text{if } n \text{ is even} 
\end{cases}
$$
$求a_1c_1 + a_2c_2 + \cdots + a_{2n}c_{2n} (n \in \mathbb{N}^).$

solution:
$b_{1}=\frac{1}{2}$,

$\because \frac{a_{n+1}}{2^{n+1}}=\frac{a_{n}}{2^{n}}+\frac{3}{4}, \therefore b_{n+1}-b_{n}=\frac{3}{4}, \therefore\left\{b_{n}\right\}$ 是等差数列;

$\therefore b_{n}=\frac{1}{2}+(n-1) \times \frac{3}{4}=\frac{1}{4}(3 n-1) ， \therefore a_{n}=(3 n-1) \cdot 2^{n-2}$.

